  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;en mars 2024: 1) atteint 878 467 personnes, dont 389 293 femmes et filles, gr&#xe2;ce aux campagnes de sensibilisation sur l&#x2019;importance de la scolarisation des filles; 2) form&#xe9; 975 enseignants, dont 97 femmes, sur la r&#xe9;duction des barri&#xe8;res sexosp&#xe9;cifiques &#xe0; l&#x2019;&#xe9;ducation; 3) form&#xe9; 575 enseignants, dont 53 femmes, pour promouvoir l&#x2019;acc&#xe8;s et le maintien des adolescentes &#xe0; l&#x2019;&#xe9;cole; 4) dot&#xe9; 90 &#xe9;coles d&#x2019;infrastructures en eau, hygi&#xe8;ne et assainissement adapt&#xe9;es aux besoins des filles; 5) appuy&#xe9; 5 632 &#xe9;l&#xe8;ves, dont 2 662 filles, &#xe0; b&#xe9;n&#xe9;ficier d&#x2019;un appui &#xe0; la r&#xe9;ussite scolaire (cours de rattrapage).</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of March include: (1) reached 878,467 people, including 389,293 women and girls by awareness campaigns on the importance of girls&apos; education; (2) trained 975 teachers, including 97 women, on reducing gender barriers to education; (3) trained 575 teachers, including 53 women, to promote access and retention of adolescent girls in school; (4) equipped 90 schools  with water, hygiene and sanitation infrastructure adapted to the needs of girls; and (5) supported 5,632 students, including 2,662 girls, to benefit from academic success (remedial courses).</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) acc&#xe8;s &#xe9;quitable et maintien accru des adolescentes, y compris celles qui sont handicap&#xe9;es, a  une &#xe9;ducation de qualit&#xe9; et inclusive, et a  un environnement d&#x2019;apprentissage s&#xe9;curitaire dans la r&#xe9;gion de S&#xe9;gou; 2) pratiques professionnelles am&#xe9;lior&#xe9;es des agents du minist&#xe8;re de l&#x2019;&#xc9;ducation nationale, incluant les structures d&#xe9;concentr&#xe9;es et les enseignants, favorisant l&#x2019;inclusion et les apprentissages des adolescentes.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) increased equitable access for adolescent girls, including those with disabilities, to quality and inclusive education and a safe learning environment in the S&#xe9;gou region; and (2) improved professional practices of the Ministry of National Education officials, including decentralized structures and teachers, to promote the inclusion and learning of adolescent girls.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
